parts.text:
Now config-less views Rectangle, Circle, Capsule, Ellipse, Divider, Spacer. Replace `of()` with `with()` returning ViewBuilder.

Rectangle:
```java
    /** A rectangle shape. */
    public static Rectangle of() {
        return new Rectangle();
    }
```
→
```java
    /** A rectangle shape. */
    public static ViewBuilder<Rectangle, Config> with() {
        return new ViewBuilder<>(new Rectangle());
    }
```

Same for others. Note Rectangle already imports nothing; ViewBuilder is same package. Good.

